    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45056" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spissāmentum</span></b> , i, n.
		spisso, that which is used to compress or stop up any
		thing, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
			stopple</i>, <i>plug</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">firmiori (quam cera) spissamento opus est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 31, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spissamento facto de harundinum foliis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					12, 49, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">faeniculi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 12, 49, 4, § 6</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">12, 7, 3</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">12, 9,
		2</span></i>.</div>
